<title>GERMANY: Strabag gets contract for Bremen canal.</title>
<headline>Strabag gets contract for Bremen canal.</headline>
<dateline>COLOGNE, Germany 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>German construction group Strabag AG said on Tuesday it was part of a consortium awarded a 218 million mark contract to build a canal lock in Bremen, Germany.</p>
<p>Strabag said its share of the deal, which it said would help secure about 8,000 jobs in the region, was worth about 93 million marks.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
